# enterprise-linux -- EDR / MDM agent slot (layer 14, CONTROL-API.md §5).
# Agents install under /opt/el-agents/<vendor>/ via a signed package; we trust
# the package database (rpm backend) for their files, so no path-wide allow is
# needed here. This file only documents the slot and gives agents with
# self-updating binaries (outside RPM) a place for a vendor-specific rule,
# reviewed per vendor. Example (keep disabled until reviewed):
# allow perm=execute all : dir=/opt/el-agents/vendor-x/ trust=1
